# A literal and a position's value are both true with the built-in boolean and.
define the potential action<my.domain.com:my_lib:/test> {
    it also assigns the position</powered>.
    it also assigns the position</both>.
    it happens when {
        this particle is created.
    } and it does {
        create a particle in position</powered>.
        create a particle in position</both>.
        set the value of position</powered> to literal<standard:/boolean>"true".
        execute the operation<standard:/boolean/and> {
            with view<a> looking at position</powered>.
            with view<b> looking at literal<standard:/boolean>"true".
            with view<result> looking at position</both>.
        }
    }
}
